    section: "A", questionRef: "2026 HL Q8(a)(ii)",
    questionText: "Explain the purpose of wheel dressing in grinding operations.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"fixed"}, totalMarks: 6,
    rows: [
    { id: "r-1", kind: "point", verbatim: "Wheel dressing restores grinding wheel sharpness and corrects irregularities such as loss of concentricity or surface undulations. While wheels are designed to self-dress, dressing removes clogged or worn abrasive grains, exposing fresh cutting edges. This process improves cutting performance, surface finish and workpiece accuracy while also reducing vibration and overheating during grinding.", marks: 6 },
    ],
